<tr><td class="tx2" style="padding-top:12px;color:#374151;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6">{{ ({created:'A Staff review spotted a defect that needs fixing. No need to worry, this is a normal follow-up: take a look when you can and agree the next step together. It’s due on ',updated:'There’s a small update on this corrective action. Open it whenever you’re ready to see what changed. It’s due on ',reminder:'This case is due on ',overdue:'This case was due on ',done:'Thanks for following it through! It was due on ',cancelled:'No further work is needed. It was due on '})[($json.kind==='updated'&&['Resolved','Closed'].includes($json.state)?'done':$json.kind==='updated'&&$json.state==='Cancelled'?'cancelled':$json.kind)] }}<b class="tx" style="color:#111827">{{ DateTime.fromISO($json.due_at).setZone('Asia/Kuala_Lumpur').toFormat("cccc, d LLL 'at' h:mm a") }}</b>{{ ({created:'.',updated:'.',reminder:' and is still open. A quick look at progress is all it needs.',overdue:' and is still open. No stress, could you check in with the person responsible today and update the case?',done:'. Nothing else is needed unless the case is reopened.',cancelled:'.'})[($json.kind==='updated'&&['Resolved','Closed'].includes($json.state)?'done':$json.kind==='updated'&&$json.state==='Cancelled'?'cancelled':$json.kind)] }}</td></tr>
